[00:13.50]Jesus has commanded
[00:17.10]That we shine our light,
[00:21.30]Like the sun, impartial,
[00:25.10]Comforting and bright.
[00:29.62]Through the Holy Scriptures,
[00:33.63]Thoughts of peace are heard.
[00:37.98]May we now reflect his light
[00:42.30]As we teach God’s Word.
[00:50.52]Let God’s Kingdom message
[00:53.78]Speak to ev’ry heart;
[00:58.90]Let it shine before us
[01:03.14]As we play our part.
[01:07.34]Light from Scripture guides us
[01:11.50]As we bring good news.
[01:16.08]Sharing truth with ev’ryone;
[01:19.38]Truth is theirs to choose.
[01:28.52]Light from acts of kindness
[01:31.50]Brightens up this world,
[01:36.07]To our words adds beauty
[01:40.00]Like a priceless pearl.
[01:44.64]May our light keep shining
[01:49.06]As we do what’s right,
[01:53.26]Then our works will always be
[01:57.44]Pleasing in God’s sight.
